{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e72f698c-9f58-8e84-814f-96070e8b22ba",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T09:32:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Vincent Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:31:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:31:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good morning. Vincent Santoro here. I'm calling about, uh, a curb cut. Like a second one. For a garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where's the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:31:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "454 Broadway, up the North End. I got the one driveway now, and I'm putting up a garage in back, so I figure I need another opening on the street. Or do I just widen the one I got? See, I don't know which it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:31:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Those are two different things, Mr. Santoro. Widening an existing cut and adding a second one are handled differently. You're talking about a brand new opening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:31:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A new one. Wait, so widening is a different permit? I thought it was all the same form. The driveway one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's all under the driveway curb cut permit, but a second cut gets looked at harder. They check the sidewalk, the street, sight lines, that kind of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:32:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So does somebody have to come out and inspect it? Or is that just for the garage itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, usually. The garage has its own inspections through the building side, and the curb cut gets looked at before and after the work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before and after. Hold on, let me write that. Sorry, I got the pen but not the paper. [pause] Okay. I'm in a band, weekends, I play bass, so I'm used to counting to four, not to three permits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's two, the curb cut and the building permit for the garage. Come by the office or I can have the application sent over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Send it. The number here is 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:32:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll get it out today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T09:32:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So that's two permits, and an inspection on the cut. I think I got it. Thanks."
    }
  ],
